=== 2. CORRECT examples: 2×2 and a general [[a,b],[c,d]] parameterization ===
A = [[1.0, 0.0], [-1.0, 1.0]]  Ainv = [[1.0, 0.0], [1.0, 1.0]]
A ones = [1. 0.] (should be e1)
e1ᵀ A = [1. 0.] (should be e1ᵀ)
A Ainv = [[1. 0.]
 [0. 1.]]  Ainv A = [[1. 0.]
 [0. 1.]]
F ones = [1. 1.]
F' = A F Ainv = [[ 1. -1.]
 [ 0. -1.]]
F' e1 = [1. 0.] (should be e1)
e1ᵀ F' A = [ 2. -1.] versus e1ᵀ F = [ 2. -1.] (should be equal)
e1ᵀ (A v) == e1ᵀ v for random v : True
